    {
      "id": "claim_5f7b589c9aba416c9b4fff4d63e3c8de",
      "statement": "scripts/zf_openwiki_gate.py deterministically decides whether OpenWiki docs need a sync: it skips when openwiki/ is missing, the working tree is dirty, or HEAD has not advanced past the last docs(openwiki) sync point; when non-doc commits landed it creates at most one P2 todo task for zf-builder via create_openwiki_task - through the dashboard create-task endpoint with a SQLite fallback that stamps the task with the JSON tags [\"automerge\", \"cat:documentation\"] - and never wakes an LLM (the script always exits 0).",
      "evidence": [
