      "statement": "The React dashboard groups cards into four actor columns - Human, Todo, Running, Done (COLUMNS in dashboard/src/constants.js) - while each card renders a stage badge from STAGE_META, which maps all 13 canonical stages (triage, grill, interview, spec_draft, spec_audit, spec_approval, building, packaging, review, recovery, awaiting_merge, blocked, done) to an owner, icon, and urgency value.",
