    {
      "id": "claim_ab21cf1c983a4e3e81fdd3ce5a611a23",
      "statement": "Beyond the on-demand cron trigger, the dispatch cycle itself spawns idle improvement scans: for each board whose running count dropped below the idle threshold with a todo backlog at or below idle_scan_max_todo (default 2), the scheduler checks the active-scanner PID map and the per-board cooldown (idle_scan_cooldown_minutes, default 15) and, when due, calls spawn_board_scanner to launch a zf-orchestrator scanner worker.",
