    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bf4eeecfbd214c85b3829eff13233e87",
      "statement": "Periodic automation is materialized as built-in cron job families in dashboard/routes/cron.py, persisted in the settings table under cron_enabled_<job_id> and scan_on_idle_<slug>: zero-factory-task-queue-check (core, runs run_dispatch_cycle), zero-factory-daily-stats (core), one zero-factory-improvement-scanner-<slug> per board (idle scan, disabled by default, spawns a zf-orchestrator scanner), and one zero-factory-openwiki-update-<slug> per board; ensure_builtin_cron_jobs registers them and toggling persists the settings and kills live scanner processes on disable.",
